pc|S9|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|@S9 is the clear play here. It does not give declarer any extra tricks. If East plays any other suit, it provides declarer with an extra trick. Leading a diamond (either low or the @DA) allows declarer to win the @DK. If East plays a club, that gives declarer a ruff-stuff, allowing declarer to discard a diamond from dummy and ruff in his hand.|
