mb|1N|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|P|mb|2H|mb|P?|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|It is not 100% clear whether East should pass or bid 2@S. In theory West could have 5 hearts in which case 2@H is better than 2@S. But if West only has 4 hearts, which is more likely, then a 5-2 fit is better than a 4-3 fit. |
