UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I like to address a couple of minor points on the bidding. I agree with West's first pass over the double, although 1@S is also possible and might be what I bid. In IMPs it is also okay to pass 1N. But in Match Points I would bid 2@S over 1N, though that is risky. That is why with 5 decent spades I would bid a slightly understrength 1@S over the double.|
PG| ***** 111 ***** |


